From ff996f95ba1738a46d09f3645a73cc7d96c13ed1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 09:29:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] WIP: mdns-sd as the published crate plus three patches;
 vendor-check reads crate archives

The vendored copy is now crates.io's mdns-sd 0.21.4 archive (sha256 as
Cargo.lock recorded it) plus the patches, and ci/vendor.conf names it.
Cached records no longer have timers; the run loop sleeps until the
earliest deadline among them. Legacy-unicast detection uses the
daemon's own port. Unit tests for the caps, the replacement policy, the
TTL cap, the local-link check and the reply limiter.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ENZSCiAud5Vs29ugEacpyR
