+Tell the embedder where an announcement came from
+
+`ResolvedService` carries the addresses the announcer wrote into its A
+and AAAA records, which it chooses as it likes: counting an announcer's
+instances, or rate-limiting it, by those addresses lets one host spend
+another's budget by naming it. `ResolvedService::source` is the source
+address of the packet that brought the instance's PTR record.
+
+Findings: Sukkula review 2026-09-25 kept[6] (the discovery budget keyed
+on an address the announcer chose).
